{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "散見正信二卷十一期至三卷五期"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無\n錫佛學會印行"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "重慶佛經流通處印行"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "見\n海刊十五期二卷"}
{"id": null, "n": "0199001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0199001", "type": "orig", "text": "此下由寶忍法師代講，故講記止於此。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0199002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0199002", "type": "orig", "text": "原題「出生菩提心經宗綱」，乃三十五年十月所出，今合編於此。"}
